<title>HONG KONG: Hang Lung 1995/96 net HK$2.28 bln.</title>
<headline>Hang Lung 1995/96 net HK$2.28 bln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   168.8   vs 165.1</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    45.0    vs 44.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil     vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    2,275.2 vs 2,160.4</p>
<p>    Turnover		     6,938.9 vs 5,147.2</p>
<p>    Company name		 Hang Lung Development Co Ltd</p>
